itical","due":"2026-02-16","description":"Please note that the original proof of address document must be certified as a true copy. Please submit a certified copy of the original proof of address document.","notes":null},{"title":"Oleksandr Borodiuk - Source of Wealth","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-02-16","description":"Please note that the 2024 and 2025 tax returns submitted must be certified as a true copy. Please submit additional evidence of source of wealth in support of the amount the UBO will use from savings to fund the business. All documents submitted must be certified as a true copy.","notes":null},{"title":"Oleksandr Borodiuk - Proof of Employment","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-02-16","description":"Please provide proof of current employment for Oleksandr Borodiuk as a private entrepreneur as indicated in questions 34 - 39 on the Personal History Disclosure Form. All documents submitted must be certified as a true copy. Please submit all related documents in the Source of Wealth section.","notes":null},{"title":"Directors List","tag":"Director's List","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-02-16","description":"The directors list must be certified as a true copy. Please submit a certified copy of the directors list.","notes":null},{"title":"Source of Funds of Business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-03-05","description":"Please submit certified documentation/agreements between the UBO and the applicant company, including any repayment/interest terms (if applicable) and the amount of funding the UBO will provide from his savings to fund the business.","notes":null},{"title":"Oleksandr Borodiuk - Source of Wealth","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-03-05","description":"Please note that the 2024 and 2025 tax returns submitted must be certified as a true copy. Please submit additional evidence of source of wealth in support of the amount the U